    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jiëth kiɛɛr Jɔr-dɛn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ruɔ̱ndɛ cu Jɔ-cua loth piny kä cuɛ wecdɛ ɣo̱th kɛɛl kɛnɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal, cukɛ jiɛn ni kä Ci-tim, kä cukɛ ben ni thok yiëër Jɔr-dɛn, kä cukɛ ben pua̱t thi̱n lɛɛr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ kɔr ni̱ni da̱ŋ diɔ̱k, cu kua̱r lätni ji̱ wec diaal wä la̱r lär i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yɛn, mi wiaa bööth palä kä ji̱ Lii-bay nɛn kapkɛ thanduk matdä Kuɔthdun ni Kuoth Nhial, ɛn wa̱nɔ kuɛ̈ɛ̈ nyuɔŋ kä ɣöthɛ kɔɔriɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö yɛn pua̱nykun thilɛ ram mi ci me̱t ret kɛ jɛn duɔ̱ɔ̱p ɛ wiaa thi̱n ɛ, ɛ jɛn bikɛ yɛ ku nyuɔ̱th duɔ̱ɔ̱p. Kä yɛn bia dhil tekɛ kam mi nɔ̱a̱n kä mi tɔt kɛ thanduk matdä Kuɔth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn, cu Jɔ-cua naath ku jiök i̱, “Jakɛ rɔ̱ kä lɛ̈y lɛ̈ɛ̈y nhiam Kuɔth, kɛ ɣöö iruun waaŋ bi Kuoth Nhial buɔ̱mdɛ nyoth nhiamdun kɛ lät ti ga̱ykɛ naath.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ bööth palä ku jiök i̱, “Ka̱nɛ thanduk matdä Kuɔth kä böthɛ naath kɛ jɛ.” Kä cukɛ wä thi̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial Jɔ-cua ku jiök i̱, “Ni ɛn wa̱lɛ mi, ɣän bä di̱tdu re̱p nhiam ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal. Ɛ jɛn bikɛ jɛ cu ŋa̱c ɔ ɛn ɣöö ta̱a̱ kɛɛl kɛ ji̱ ce̱tnikɛ mëë ta̱a̱ kɔnɛ Muthɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ wër ruacni kɛ bööth palä tin kapkɛ thanduk matdä kä jio̱kni kɛ i̱ mi wäkɛ wä cop wi̱i̱ yiëër kä Jɔr-dɛn, akɛ cuŋ yie̱e̱r.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ, cu Jɔ-cua ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl ben jiök i̱, “Ta̱yɛ rɔ̱ kä biaa liɛŋɛ laat Kuɔthdun in la Kuoth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn bia jɛ cu ŋa̱c nikɛ nɛmɛ ɛn ɣöö Kuoth mi tëk a rɛydun, kɛnɛ ɣöö mi wiaa ko̱r kap, jɛn bɛ ji̱ Kɛ-naan kɛ ji̱ Ɣɛ̈th kɛ ji̱ Iwi kɛ ji̱ Pɛ-rii-dhi kɛ ji̱ Gir-gac kɛ ji̱ Ɛ-mor amäni ji̱ Yɛ-buth jak kä bath ni ca̱r nhiamdun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bia jɛ ŋa̱c kɛ ɣöö mi wä thanduk matdä Kua̱r ni gua̱n wec muɔ̱ɔ̱n kɛɛliw yɛ böth Jɔr-dɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ yɛn täämɛ kuɛ̈ɛ̈ nɛy da̱ŋ wäl rɛw ka̱n kä döör I-thɛ-rɛl, ram kɛl do̱o̱r ɔ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi wä bööth palä tin kapkɛ thanduk matdä Kuɔth Nhial in la Kuäär wec muɔ̱ɔ̱n kɛɛliw pa̱a̱t ciöknikiɛn cua̱th yie̱e̱r kä Jɔr-dɛn, bi löny yiëër ɛmɔ cuɔ̱ŋ kä bi pi̱ tin lony ni kui̱c i̱ wee nhial i̱ rɔ̱ rol guäth kɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ jɛn, mëë ci naath ɣöth ni gua̱thni gɔalikiɛn kä wäkɛ yi̱er jiɛ̈th kui̱c, cua kɛ bo̱th ɛ bööth palä tin kapkɛ thanduk matdä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ ci kir Jɔr-dɛn muak ci wäŋkɛ diaal wä raar amäni gua̱a̱th ŋër bɛɛl. Kä mëë ci nɛy tëë kapkɛ thanduk matdä ruac cop kä Jɔr-dɛn, mëë ci ciök bööthni palä tëë kapkɛ thanduk cop rɛy pi̱i̱ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cu pi̱w tin lo̱ny nhial rɔ̱ ka̱p cuɔ̱ŋ, cukɛ rɔ̱ luth guäth kɛl ni nɔ̱nä kä A-dam, wec in te gekä Dha-rɛ-than. Kä cu tha̱a̱ŋ pi̱i̱ni lo̱ny baar Ä-ra-ba min la Bar in Wac guäth in cu pi̱ diaal ŋuɔɔk. Kä cu naath jiɛth kui̱c lotdä Jɛ-ri-ko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä guäth in jiɛ̈thkɛ yi̱er ɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p mi kööt, kɛn bööth palä tin kapkɛ thanduk matdä tekɛ cuŋä guäth mi kööt däär yiëër Jɔr-dɛn, amäni mëë cu do̱r ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl thuɔ̱k kɛ jiëth kɛɛliw.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
